        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Screen/display hardware problem: presenter reports the screen is missing ('where has my screen gone?' / 'My screen is gone')"
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006a#1",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Kickoff participation shows participants slow and under-prepared, indicating preparation/coordination gaps."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006a#2",
        "type": "problems",
        "text": "Unclear scope: unclear which animal to draw and lack of agreement on subject and components to include."
      },
      {
        "item_key": "TS3006a#3",
        "type": "decisions",
        "text": "Pricing will be set at 25 Euros."
      },
